#: ../../tools/mcule_tools.rst:134 6b2d459e281649d89df8b7cf0ff1b005
msgid "**Name**: ``Mcule_lookup_compound``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mcule_tools.rst:136 d316492f4acc4e5087136098ed73bb55
msgid ""
"**Description**: Look up purchasable compounds on Mcule by SMILES, "
"InChIKey, or Mcule ID. Mcule aggregates 30M+ compounds from multiple "
"chemical suppliers. Returns matching Mcule IDs and SMILES structures. "
"Accepts any chemical identifier: SMILES string (e.g., "
"CC(=O)Oc1ccccc1C(=O)O for aspirin), InChIKey (e.g., BSYNRYMUTXBXSQ-"
"UHFFFAOYSA-N), or Mcule ID (e.g., MCULE-3199019536). Use this as the "
"first step to find a compound's Mcule ID, then use Mcule\\_get\\_compound"
" for full details. Public endpoint, no auth required (rate limit: "
"10/min)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mcule_tools.rst:143 3b070ea9dd5a490ebfb5188310f9a63c
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Chemical identifier to look up: SMILES "
"string, InChIKey, or Mcule ID (e.g., CC(=O)Oc1ccccc1C(=O)O, "
"BSYNRYMUTXBXSQ-UHFFFAOYSA-N, or MCULE-3199019536)"
msgstr ""

